      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are still the person you were, and the loss of the fellowship does not erase who you are. Your parents will see the same person they always knew, just a little more honest and less perfect. You can go back to the house, but this time you will carry the weight of your own story, not just the weight of expectations. It is a natural step to let go of the old identity and find a new purpose that does not depend on being flawless.",
