      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not a failure, but a person who has simply lost a part of themselves and is now free to redefine what that means. The promise you made was to yourself, not to the world, and it is not a failure to be a person who can no longer be counted on. You can outrun the feeling of disappointment by choosing to be the one who can keep the promise to yourself, not to others. The only thing you need is the courage to be the person you were always meant to be.",
      "source": "target",
